      "updated": 1772668845886,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every payment is a 2-in-2-out\ntransaction (like Bitcoin UTXOs).\nAgent picks notes, spends them,\ngets change back as a new note.\nArbitrary amounts — no fixed\ndenominations required.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 8,
