      "text": "Zero-knowledge proof system.\nNo trusted setup required.\nBN254 elliptic curve, ~12,400\nconstraints. Circom 2-in-2-out\ncircuit. Runs client-side via\nsnarkjs in ~60 seconds.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 8,
